  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我刚刚从南口回来。",
      "output_sha256": "fc7991dbfa0bdf939daed779d026ffa39858b9ed40352273eaaacea5ce6753b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.6825,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ed9d9f977a3e8da2a008bdb27c52ffd3253a134d5eaf84530b3208bb24b3fed9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fc7991dbfa0bdf939daed779d026ffa39858b9ed40352273eaaacea5ce6753b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "天气异常炎热，朝南的房间温度高达九十度以上，两小时的火车旅程如同在火窑中受煎熬，坐着的感觉尤为难受。",
      "output_sha256": "810f749fe8d553fdc48b9bceada640ec4c98cf1f3eaceb8abb82ea958887ed96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.530802,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c619934c17b0467bf3c34f218fabce34a495b76b51de78d8a5d9b67d34e81dfe"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "810f749fe8d553fdc48b9bceada640ec4c98cf1f3eaceb8abb82ea958887ed96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们今天一早在野鸟开唱以前就起身，不到六时就骑骡出发，除了在永陵休息半小时以外，一直到下午一时余，只是在高度的日光下赶路。",
      "output_sha256": "a2955483e76ea6d40358edb1a7364dd36e905312d2b152431fae4910c13db455",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "a2955483e76ea6d40358edb1a7364dd36e905312d2b152431fae4910c13db455",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "回到家时，四肢的肌肉感到像被细麻绳紧紧捆住似的难受，头里的血液如沸水般急流，神经受到强烈的压迫，仿佛无数烧红的铁蛇交缠在一起，令人窒息。",
      "output_sha256": "136dc50c996d2edd33216cf9b0379eef3be7ec9d1f9275d07eb5a36b91a92fa7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.625443,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1379ec160f4cea7874a77a705583fa958d9918a0cff57cc409dda7ee511d9c6d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "136dc50c996d2edd33216cf9b0379eef3be7ec9d1f9275d07eb5a36b91a92fa7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一进阴凉的屋子，只觉得一阵眩晕从头顶直至踵底，不仅眼前望不清楚，连身子也有些支援不住。",
      "output_sha256": "0d51d1a7045522bcb241c69e8726ee9621debcab75d0bf214e0a7996418bf267",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d51d1a7045522bcb241c69e8726ee9621debcab75d0bf214e0a7996418bf267",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我就向着最近的藤椅上瘫了下去，两手按住急颤的前胸，紧闭着眼，纵容内心的浑沌，一片暗黄，一片茶青，一片墨绿，影片似的在倦绝的眼膜上扯过……",
      "output_sha256": "c6b19ac749d2a9a2336e59b4fb25e09e274ed7d374a9de424c0776399e91bb08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "c6b19ac749d2a9a2336e59b4fb25e09e274ed7d374a9de424c0776399e91bb08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "直到洗过了澡，神志方才回复清醒，身子也觉得异常的爽快，我就想了……",
      "output_sha256": "8e907eebfbd8defde5fbacfa5ed1c5e29bf78f725715ea12ca41e3b347350860",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e907eebfbd8defde5fbacfa5ed1c5e29bf78f725715ea12ca41e3b347350860",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "人啊，你不自己惭愧吗？",
      "output_sha256": "ba035d46bef4238f3ca4571c039a8a88a455c2f91f9b3ac489422e888407832c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "ba035d46bef4238f3ca4571c039a8a88a455c2f91f9b3ac489422e888407832c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "野兽，自然的，强悍的，活泼的，美丽的；我只是羡慕你。",
      "output_sha256": "b3ae089c1c7697dc634dc9e4b4b9b635a3e74fd12df5c32d195afbf92cd92601",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "b3ae089c1c7697dc634dc9e4b4b9b635a3e74fd12df5c32d195afbf92cd92601",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "什么是文明？",
      "output_sha256": "b87934018ff20462c73959060a19f1de656aae5bdc8b3cf84b03c5d9e881c934",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.694683,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0c73d0de6055cc1da7431101467bbca8146baf72b9701d54db7d3e5ec646f402"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b87934018ff20462c73959060a19f1de656aae5bdc8b3cf84b03c5d9e881c934",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不过是腐化的野兽！",
      "output_sha256": "eb626c454152e70999ab2890d52747a0e8fce0fb9daf9f5d447fc8a41501935a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.694683,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0c73d0de6055cc1da7431101467bbca8146baf72b9701d54db7d3e5ec646f402"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eb626c454152e70999ab2890d52747a0e8fce0fb9daf9f5d447fc8a41501935a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果将一个习惯于文明的人类剥去他的衣物装饰，夺去他伪装的工具──语言文字，赤裸裸地放在荒野中看看──他简直成了一个可怜的畜生！",
      "output_sha256": "5662e525cf8bef4d6b8ed1b98c787ae5f57736685a2144d074643c3221d90a29",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.585864,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1f905872a711a45189140e71d735f9cddda726507f266fa364d7cafdf7a96f21"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5662e525cf8bef4d6b8ed1b98c787ae5f57736685a2144d074643c3221d90a29",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "恐怕连长耳朵的小骡儿，都瞧他不起哪！",
      "output_sha256": "3e71278abf6a46c7a08be3283c5fdbf7a458729a4e43af7110e5ae0e3ca48bf1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e71278abf6a46c7a08be3283c5fdbf7a458729a4e43af7110e5ae0e3ca48bf1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "白天，狼虎放平在丛林里睡觉，他躲在树荫底下发痧；",
      "output_sha256": "6ff28f604b27ada7761c66ff5b09770157da736a1942f8cc7a74aeec8c2eee50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "6ff28f604b27ada7761c66ff5b09770157da736a1942f8cc7a74aeec8c2eee50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "晚上清风在树林中演奏轻微的妙乐，鸟雀儿在巢里做好梦，他倒在一块石上发烧咳嗽──着了凉！",
      "output_sha256": "318dfabd5af222e1dcfbdec6b000b2f00da99b2cdc80d99991e8e70c385fbbad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "318dfabd5af222e1dcfbdec6b000b2f00da99b2cdc80d99991e8e70c385fbbad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "也不等狼虎去商量他有限的皮肉。",
      "output_sha256": "56e89ee732e124707364ba6ec3a465aed59fff5465fe4560297e7373ea8a95e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "56e89ee732e124707364ba6ec3a465aed59fff5465fe4560297e7373ea8a95e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "也不必小雀儿去嘲笑他的懦弱；单是他平常歌颂的艳阳与凉风，甘霖与朝露，已够他的受用：在几小时之内可使他脑子里消灭了金钱、名誉、经济、主义等等的虚景，在一半天之内，可使他心窝里消灭了人生的情感悲乐种种的幻象，在三两天之内──如其那时还不曾受淘汰──可使他整个的超出了文明人的丑态，那时就叫他放下两只手来替脚子分走路的负担，他也不以为离奇，抵拚撕破皮肉爬上树去采果子吃，也不会感觉到体面的观念……",
      "output_sha256": "f22faa52459a13276cdf47440fffc4ceba88d8d23110dd0ce855fdded05f9c21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "f22faa52459a13276cdf47440fffc4ceba88d8d23110dd0ce855fdded05f9c21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "平常见了活泼可爱的野兽，就想起红烧野味之美，现在你失去了文明的保障，但求彼此平等待遇两不相犯，已是万分的侥幸……",
      "output_sha256": "dce7cd70675637d2f4fc0d8c0ff29faaa41b5a43c1b9329c87b2718d6f751b69",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "dce7cd70675637d2f4fc0d8c0ff29faaa41b5a43c1b9329c87b2718d6f751b69",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "文明只是个荒谬的状况；文明人只是个凄惨的现象，──",
      "output_sha256": "f5a96711789cc2b130079a355de641e71125b4fe73f5ad3e849f2ac0382a062a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "f5a96711789cc2b130079a355de641e71125b4fe73f5ad3e849f2ac0382a062a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我骑在骡上嚷累叫热，跟着哑巴的骡夫，比手势告诉我他整天的跑路，天还不算顶热，他一路很快活的不时采一朵野花，拆一茎麦穗，笑他古怪的笑，唱他哑巴的歌；我们到了客寓喝冰汽水喘息，他路过一条小涧时，扑下去喝一个贴面饱，同行的有一位说：“真的，他们这样的胡喝，就不会害病，真贱！”",
      "output_sha256": "b2bcea6ae204c5369380c0ab4182ac2d6938895ec3092451d9948a9401cf568b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "b2bcea6ae204c5369380c0ab4182ac2d6938895ec3092451d9948a9401cf568b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "回头上了头等车坐在皮倚上嚷累叫热，又是一瓶两瓶的冰水，还怪嫌车里不安电扇；同时前面火车头里司机的加煤的，在一百四五十度的高温里笑他们的笑，谈他们的谈……",
      "output_sha256": "8d98c53256f87ccf124087a21f0bc5568e6cfd3e58c0dbf911c9445d04dce19b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d98c53256f87ccf124087a21f0bc5568e6cfd3e58c0dbf911c9445d04dce19b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "田里刈麦的农夫拱着棕黑色的裸背在工作，从早起已经做了八九时的工，热烈的阳光在他们的皮上像在打出火星来似的，但他们却不曾嚷腰酸叫头痛……",
      "output_sha256": "ae60d67e64b67464cdc46a9493972c4d36ad06cac23b421f75b2e940be43096a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae60d67e64b67464cdc46a9493972c4d36ad06cac23b421f75b2e940be43096a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们无法否认人是万物之灵；但我们同样可以断定，人是万物之淫。",
      "output_sha256": "acf06fd80707a0e57f1e33cc5276808957d17d980ff6f944e6424d938f3602c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.673576,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a5186de19f573cccce2893b1d0e64f2e94bd1371cff67655879824e85541d9d1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "acf06fd80707a0e57f1e33cc5276808957d17d980ff6f944e6424d938f3602c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "什么是现代的文明；只是一个淫的现象。",
      "output_sha256": "8e5a91f4f0c3ce8c6af614a8f250de32d7efb95f2ccbe903c80d7df352a355d0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e5a91f4f0c3ce8c6af614a8f250de32d7efb95f2ccbe903c80d7df352a355d0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "淫的代价是活力之腐败与人道之丑化。",
      "output_sha256": "5ec5383412159bb611c28514ffc22695e3bd3fb201a99683e9256b189141d223",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ec5383412159bb611c28514ffc22695e3bd3fb201a99683e9256b189141d223",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "前方是什么呢？",
      "output_sha256": "ea673b1591542be2c4fdaf45cd8240b1495b487584ed57d25d3add016299cbea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.58829,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b4881fc322383db6af6ceb27e75bf7f653c7da37f4d893ea1bad1ca59f97968c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ea673b1591542be2c4fdaf45cd8240b1495b487584ed57d25d3add016299cbea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25,
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "没有别的，只是一张黑暗的大口，在我们所走的路上张开，等待着我们，时机一到将我们完全吞噬，了事！",
      "output_sha256": "6de7a590783db22b0cfce9c373be122f9fe7fc91162b9521b7c07e5a2a42798d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.58829,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b4881fc322383db6af6ceb27e75bf7f653c7da37f4d893ea1bad1ca59f97968c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6de7a590783db22b0cfce9c373be122f9fe7fc91162b9521b7c07e5a2a42798d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
